 [case id=session-044-tls-attr-not-trusted level=core gate=enforced
  [tags session attach CXER4806 tls-forgery transport-attested hostile]
  [doc [#
HOSTILE (major): a caller-set `tls="true"` attr on a hand-built [request] used
to satisfy the §2.4 TLS bright-line. Only the transport-derived `scheme` is
trusted now; a forged `tls` attr (no https scheme) is refused CXER4806.
#]]
  [in-cx [#
[empty]
#]]
  [in-code [#
[?lib 'cx-stdlib/session']
[?lib 'cx-stdlib/crypto']
